18.15
01:05:10.154 --> 01:10:28.034
Mapping programmer-visible blocks to warps and streaming multiprocessors

18.16
01:10:28.034 --> 01:21:07.034
Branch divergence, active masks, SIMD utilization, and dynamic warp formation

18.17
01:21:07.034 --> 01:24:59.594
GPU analysis, homework hints, warp scheduling for memory latency, and subwarping

18.18
01:24:59.594 --> 01:31:49.954
Evolution of NVIDIA GPUs: shader cores, Tensor Cores, sparsity support, and low-precision data types

18.19
01:31:49.954 --> 01:34:07.234
Wrap-up: trade-offs among GPUs, systolic arrays, FPGAs, and heterogeneous systems for machine learning
